# ending-a -- A for four frames out of every sixty-four, from frame 1000.
#
# For --goto mstory2dll:4:C (M38, PLAN.md 53.8): the story ending is a
# dialogue that waits for A on each line before the ending movie; the movie
# itself cannot be skipped (src/REL/mstory2Dll/ending.c: its HuTHPEndCheck
# loop reads no pad), so a metronome carries the run through to it.

